## 1. Stock behaviour at cf34d311 for `-ngl 99 -cmoe -lm mmap`

**Argv.**
- `-cmoe/--cpu-moe` -> `common/arg.cpp:2731-2735` pushes `llm_ffn_exps_cpu_override()` (`common/common.h:1267`) =
